01:04:19.610 --> 01:04:21.612
Alright, here we go!
It's gonna be alright.


01:04:21.695 --> 01:04:24.448
Help me please..please..
Help me...


01:04:24.531 --> 01:04:26.658
Wait a sec!
I just thought of something.


01:04:27.075 --> 01:04:28.660
Jen.


01:04:28.952 --> 01:04:30.162
Jen, you're the girl for me.


01:04:30.245 --> 01:04:32.539
You don't know me.
But you make me so happy.


01:04:32.623 --> 01:04:35.584
I tried to call you before,
but I lost my nerve.


01:04:35.792 --> 01:04:38.420
I used my imagination.


01:04:38.629 --> 01:04:41.215
But I was disturbed.


01:04:41.715 --> 01:04:44.843
Jenny, I got your number.


01:04:45.052 --> 01:04:48.013
I need to make you mine.


01:04:48.222 --> 01:04:51.475
Jenny, don’t change your number,


01:04:51.558 --> 01:04:54.728
..8-6-7-5-3-0-9....


01:04:54.853 --> 01:04:57.815
..8-6-7-5-3-0-9....


01:04:59.274 --> 01:05:02.653
..8-6-7-5-3-0-9....


01:05:10.327 --> 01:05:12.329
They killed you.
- Oops!


01:05:12.538 --> 01:05:14.248
I'm still here, aren't I?


01:05:14.540 --> 01:05:17.376
I mean, they did go Benihana
on my ass with that knife.


01:05:17.459 --> 01:05:19.336
And it should have killed me but...


01:05:19.545 --> 01:05:21.380
..for some reason...


01:05:21.588 --> 01:05:23.173
..it didn't.


01:05:25.217 --> 01:05:26.927
Maybe it did.


01:05:53.996 --> 01:05:56.540
Anyway, I don't really remember
what happened after that.


01:05:56.623 --> 01:05:59.334
I just know that I woke up and...


01:05:59.543 --> 01:06:01.962
..I found my way back to you.


01:06:14.141 --> 01:06:15.851
I remember.


01:06:16.810 --> 01:06:19.104
I couldn't bring myself to hurt you.


01:06:19.313 --> 01:06:21.732
I mean, I'm a really good friend.


01:06:22.566 --> 01:06:25.402
I was just so hungry.


01:06:44.838 --> 01:06:46.423
Ahmet!


01:06:47.925 --> 01:06:49.635
You made it out?


01:06:53.764 --> 01:06:55.474
Are you lost?


01:06:58.393 --> 01:07:01.021
Does your host family know that
you're alive?


01:07:04.525 --> 01:07:06.944
Does anyone know you're alive?


01:07:12.908 --> 01:07:14.701
You come with me.


01:07:15.118 --> 01:07:16.829
We will sort this out.


01:07:18.747 --> 01:07:22.835
And ever since then, I just knew what
I have to do to be strong.


01:07:23.085 --> 01:07:26.880
And when I'm full, like I'm right now.
I'm like...


01:07:27.381 --> 01:07:28.799
..unkillable.


01:07:28.924 --> 01:07:30.926
Like I can do shit like this.
Watch!


01:07:33.846 --> 01:07:35.973
It's really cool.
Just relax. Look.


01:07:39.852 --> 01:07:41.979
It's like some X-Men shit, right?


01:07:48.443 --> 01:07:51.697
What do you mean, when you're full?


01:07:55.033 --> 01:07:57.327
What about my mom's Kia?


01:07:57.619 --> 01:07:59.913
