01:08:00.038 --> 01:08:02.457
You didn't even look human.


01:08:05.210 --> 01:08:08.672
You know, Needy, maybe you should
talk to somebody about these...


01:08:08.755 --> 01:08:10.883
..disturbing thoughts.


01:08:10.966 --> 01:08:14.761
..that you're having. 
 We're all really concerned.


01:08:15.804 --> 01:08:17.806
Especially, Chip.


01:08:18.223 --> 01:08:20.851
I think he may be having
second thoughts about you.


01:08:20.934 --> 01:08:21.935
Leave!


01:08:22.102 --> 01:08:24.396
Come on, Needy.
Let me stay the night.


01:08:24.521 --> 01:08:27.900
We can play 'boyfriend/girlfriend'
like we used to.


01:08:42.915 --> 01:08:45.751
What are you doing? 
 - Um, you said to leave.


01:08:46.168 --> 01:08:48.170
See you at school.


01:09:13.487 --> 01:09:17.991
We're gathered here to celebrate 
 the life of Collin Gray.


01:09:18.575 --> 01:09:20.994
Who was plucked from the prime
of his youth.


01:09:32.756 --> 01:09:36.426
<i>They did a big memorial assembly
for Collin at school.</i>


01:09:37.344 --> 01:09:39.638
<i>And we had to watch another
presentation about curfews...</i>


01:09:39.721 --> 01:09:43.100
<i>..and the buddy system and
how to deal with grief.</i>


01:09:43.559 --> 01:09:45.978
<i>But nobody seemed to care anymore.</i>


01:09:46.603 --> 01:09:49.231
<i>Sorrow was last week's emotion.</i>


01:09:51.316 --> 01:09:54.278
<i>Sure we all hope this would be
the last funeral.</i>


01:09:54.611 --> 01:09:56.321
<i>But I knew better.</i>


01:09:56.989 --> 01:09:59.116
<i>So I did some research.</i>


01:09:59.658 --> 01:10:01.660
<i>Paranormal research.</i>


01:10:15.465 --> 01:10:17.885
<b>OFFERING A VIRGIN TO SATAN.</b>


01:10:19.303 --> 01:10:24.224
..forever feed on flesh to...


01:10:24.683 --> 01:10:26.685
Destroying a demon.


01:10:27.019 --> 01:10:29.313
Demons are weakest when hungry.


01:10:29.396 --> 01:10:34.067
But a blade to the heart is the
surest way to kill the beast.


01:10:39.031 --> 01:10:43.118
<i>Jennifer and I hadn't spoken since
our encounter in my room.</i>


01:10:43.911 --> 01:10:46.747
<i>Actually, I hadn't really spoken to anyone.</i>


01:11:04.389 --> 01:11:05.974
Hey.


01:11:07.017 --> 01:11:09.019
I just bought our formal tickets.


01:11:09.102 --> 01:11:11.939
Did you make reservations at
the Cheesecake Factory?


01:11:13.398 --> 01:11:15.818
Chip, I can't go to the dance
with you.


01:11:15.901 --> 01:11:17.277
What? Why?


01:11:17.486 --> 01:11:19.071
Look, just trust me.


01:11:19.279 --> 01:11:20.864
You shouldn't go at all.


01:11:20.989 --> 01:11:23.700
What're you talking about? 
 - Not here.


01:11:23.909 --> 01:11:26.036
What's going on?
You're breaking up with me?


01:11:26.203 --> 01:11:28.205
Please, Chip.
I just need to tell you something.


01:11:28.413 --> 01:11:29.581
Is this about Jennifer? 
 - Yes.


01:11:29.665 --> 01:11:32.918
But I promise you this is the last time...
- Needy, I care about you.


01:11:33.001 --> 01:11:33.877
A lot.


01:11:33.961 --> 01:11:37.506
As a person, not just some girl
I made love to four minutes ago.


01:11:37.589 --> 01:11:39.883
And-And I'm scared of what's
happening to you.


01:11:40.050 --> 01:11:43.846
You're acting really fucked up. 
 - Please just let me show you.


01:11:46.723 --> 01:11:48.016
Okay.


01:11:48.100 --> 01:11:49.810
Jennifer's evil.


01:11:50.727 --> 01:11:52.020
