01:12:02.364 --> 01:12:05.617
Yeah, its-its really small...


01:12:06.368 --> 01:12:08.078
You have to read this.


01:12:10.289 --> 01:12:11.915
Demon...
- Demonic transference.


01:12:11.999 --> 01:12:13.208
It's something that happens...


01:12:13.292 --> 01:12:15.419
