01:13:22.277 --> 01:13:23.570
I'll be at the dance.


01:13:23.654 --> 01:13:25.656
I just need to keep an eye on Jennifer.


01:13:26.406 --> 01:13:28.700
Promise me, you're not gonna go.


01:13:31.829 --> 01:13:33.288
Needy, I...


01:13:33.372 --> 01:13:35.415
